{"id":"71f1954115db03be","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-projection-valued.md","title":"Projection-Valued Measure","display":"df-projection-valued — Projection-Valued Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projection-valued","aliases":["58-df-projection-valued"],"display":"df-projection-valued — Projection-Valued Measure","depends_on":["[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","[[58-df-bounded-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projection-valued"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projection-valued</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projection-valued — Projection-Valued Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal B)\">\\((X,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (measurable space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\">\\(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\)</span> (Hilbert-space structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\)</span> (Hilbert-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\\)</span> (bounded-operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E:\\mathcal B\\to V\">\\(E:\\mathcal B\\to V\\)</span> (operator-valued map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PVM}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{PVM}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (explicit structure predicate and compatibility projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}valued\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S(E,X,\\mathcal B,H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land E:\\mathcal B\\to V\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(E(A),H,H)\\land E(A)\\circ E(A)=E(A)\\\\&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v\\in H\\;B_H(E(A)(u),v)=B_H(u,E(A)(v))\\Bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land E(\\emptyset)=0_H\\land E(X)=I_H\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B^\\omega\\;\\left(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\neq j\\to A_i\\cap A_j=\\emptyset)\\to\\forall u\\in H\\;\\lim_{m\\to\\infty}\\nu_{B_H}\\!\\left(E\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_n\\right)(u)-\\sum_{n&lt;m}E(A_n)(u)\\right)=0\\right)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}valued\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S(E,X,\\mathcal B,H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land E:\\mathcal B\\to V\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(E(A),H,H)\\land E(A)\\circ E(A)=E(A)\\\\&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v\\in H\\;B_H(E(A)(u),v)=B_H(u,E(A)(v))\\Bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land E(\\emptyset)=0_H\\land E(X)=I_H\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B^\\omega\\;\\left(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\neq j\\to A_i\\cap A_j=\\emptyset)\\to\\forall u\\in H\\;\\lim_{m\\to\\infty}\\nu_{B_H}\\!\\left(E\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_n\\right)(u)-\\sum_{n&lt;m}E(A_n)(u)\\right)=0\\right)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}valued\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,X,\\mathcal B,H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S(E,X,\\mathcal B,H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}valued\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,X,\\mathcal B,H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S(E,X,\\mathcal B,H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Projection-valued measures take measurable sets to orthogonal projections and are countably additive in the strong operator topology; the displayed vector-limit clause expands that topology relative to the explicit Hilbert norm.</li>\n<li>The measurable carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is an explicit predicate argument, so the normalization equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(X)=I_H\">\\(E(X)=I_H\\)</span> is not context-dependent.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)$ (Hilbert-space predicate, see [[58-df-hilbert-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S$ (bounded-operator predicate, see [[58-df-bounded-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"E:\\mathcal B\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PVM}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}valued\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S(E,X,\\mathcal B,H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,X)\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)\\land E:\\mathcal B\\to V\\\\&\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(E(A),H,H)\\land E(A)\\circ E(A)=E(A)\\\\&\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v\\in H\\;B_H(E(A)(u),v)=B_H(u,E(A)(v))\\Bigr)\\\\&\\land E(\\emptyset)=0_H\\land E(X)=I_H\\\\&\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B^\\omega\\;\\left(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(i\\neq j\\to A_i\\cap A_j=\\emptyset)\\to\\forall u\\in H\\;\\lim_{m\\to\\infty}\\nu_{B_H}\\!\\left(E\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_n\\right)(u)-\\sum_{n<m}E(A_n)(u)\\right)=0\\right)\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}valued\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{PVM}_S(E,X,\\mathcal B,H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S(E,X,\\mathcal B,H,B_H,k,+_H,\\odot_H)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"E(X)=I_H","display":false}],"bytes":2267,"backlinks":[{"id":"a07bf08781c5a82a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PVM}_S$ (projection-valued-measure predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-projection-valued.md]])"},{"id":"2ec0511903e19292","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PVMStructure}_S$ (projection-valued-measure predicate, see [[58-df-projection-valued]])"},{"id":"e052306286085efd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-998","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-projection-valued.md|58-df-projection-valued]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a740bdad87b97ac6","b70ce791d5b1a19b","2ad9c248fe18df37"]}